nodecode-t3mp3st -- a Nodecode cell that drives a running T3MP3ST War Room.

T3MP3ST is by Pliny the Elder: https://github.com/elder-plinius/T3MP3ST
It is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0).

This cell copies no code from T3MP3ST and links nothing from it. It speaks to
the War Room that program serves on loopback -- the same HTTP/JSON API its own
UI reads -- as an independent program the user installs and runs themselves.
That separation is deliberate: the AGPL covers T3MP3ST, and this cell stays
MIT because none of T3MP3ST's code is distributed in it.

The names T3MP3ST, TEMPEST and the War Room belong to that project. This cell
is an independent client, and is not endorsed by it.

Everything here is MIT: see LICENSE.
